  "description": "ND ListView Framework provides a metadata-driven list and card stack\n\t\t\tcomponent model for .NET applications. It enables dynamic grid rendering,\n\t\t\tconfigurable columns, action metadata, and structured data retrieval\n\t\t\tthrough a clean service-oriented architecture. Designed for enterprise\n\t\t\tmicroservices and extensible UI integration.",
