  "releaseNotes": "Introduces metadata-driven list components for .NET services.\n\t\t\tAdds dynamic column, grid, and action metadata handling.\n\t\t\tImplements Command and Query (CQRS) pattern for structured data retrieval and operations.\n\t\t\tProvides extensible handler interfaces for custom business logic integration.\n\t\t\tSupports clean architecture with externalized ports and service abstractions.\n\t\t\tAdd Logging using observability framework.",
